WEBVTT

00:02.808 --> 00:04.275
Legend has it...

00:05.444 --> 00:08.242
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons...

00:08.581 --> 00:13.917
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:15.388 --> 00:20.553
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.672 --> 00:41.101
<i>Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:41.380 --> 00:47.216
<i>Rushing through my innocent
youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.754 --> 00:54.659
<i>This soul of mine is
so easy to influence.</i>

00:56.295 --> 01:00.061
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:00.166 --> 01:03.397
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:07.173 --> 01:14.238
<i>This is what I'm wishing
for as I sing this song.</i>

01:14.413 --> 01:20.249
<i>I want you to acknowledge
me, that's all.</i>

01:21.120 --> 01:28.390
<i>You smiled at me for
the very first time.</i>

01:28.527 --> 01:36.957
<i>Thank you so much, thank you
from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.670 --> 01:39.331
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:49.081 --> 01:52.517
<i>Age of Chaos
Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

01:58.524 --> 01:59.752
Shiori...

02:03.028 --> 02:04.393
Yakumo...

02:04.530 --> 02:06.020
Farewell...

02:11.303 --> 02:13.032
Big Brother Yakumo!

02:14.707 --> 02:16.038
Hey, what's going on?

02:17.176 --> 02:18.234
Come back inside.

02:18.744 --> 02:20.211
Have you seen Shiori?

02:21.480 --> 02:23.004
Wasn't she with you?

02:25.618 --> 02:26.482
Hey, wait!

02:27.219 --> 02:28.277
I'll help you look for her!

02:31.991 --> 02:32.980
Yakumo...

02:34.260 --> 02:35.056
Oh, man!

02:35.194 --> 02:36.525
Big Sister Shiori!

02:42.067 --> 02:43.898
Big Sister Shiori!

02:44.069 --> 02:45.627
Big Sister Shiori!

02:45.738 --> 02:50.698
<i>FIGHT TO THE DEATH AT SANBONMATSU</i>

03:02.788 --> 03:04.312
We'd like to speak with you.

03:04.423 --> 03:06.414
Please come with us.

03:28.447 --> 03:30.677
Big Sister Shiori!

03:33.452 --> 03:37.548
I guess she got fed up and left
because we were fooling around...

03:44.263 --> 03:46.788
Are you telling me that
man defeated you again?

03:48.000 --> 03:51.800
I admit that his prowess
exceeded my expectations...

03:52.504 --> 03:56.497
...but I assure you, my
strategy is still intact.

03:57.843 --> 03:58.775
Meaning...

03:58.877 --> 04:00.310
...you're not through with him yet?

04:02.748 --> 04:04.682
You frighten me...

04:05.017 --> 04:07.918
But you must keep this in mind.

04:08.387 --> 04:12.050
We of the Kuki Musou Style were
chosen as Official Sword Instructors.

04:12.491 --> 04:15.051
Whatever you do, it
must be a clean fight!

04:15.494 --> 04:17.052
But of course.

04:17.696 --> 04:22.656
Shinzaburo's sneakiness
and Kazuma's "honor"...

04:22.801 --> 04:24.792
...same difference, really!

04:27.873 --> 04:30.433
Big Sister Shiori!

04:31.744 --> 04:34.338
Big Sister Shiori!

04:34.580 --> 04:35.808
Hey, brat!

04:36.815 --> 04:37.975
Who the hell are you?

04:39.385 --> 04:41.785
Take this. You know who to give it to!

05:00.272 --> 05:01.967
Oh, it's you.

05:02.141 --> 05:03.233
Hey, you're...

05:05.944 --> 05:09.175
I never thought I'd
see you in such a state.

05:11.650 --> 05:13.709
Just a few minutes ago...

05:17.089 --> 05:19.990
I saw something very strange
at that corner up ahead.

05:20.092 --> 05:24.495
From the looks of them, I'd say they were
disciples from some dojo or another...

05:24.630 --> 05:27.929
...I saw them gang up on a
young samurai and take him away.

05:28.033 --> 05:29.057
I see...

05:29.268 --> 05:31.031
Hey!

05:36.508 --> 05:37.634
I was...

05:38.277 --> 05:43.010
I was standing in front of the gate, and
someone from the Kuki dojo gave me this.

05:43.415 --> 05:45.007
It looks like a letter of challenge.

05:48.020 --> 05:49.715
Tomorrow at dawn...

05:49.922 --> 05:53.756
...we challenge you to a duel
at Sanbonmatsu in Rendaigahara.

05:54.326 --> 05:59.025
They're holding Shiori hostage
to make sure it's a fair fight.

06:00.366 --> 06:02.231
What do they mean, fair?

06:02.701 --> 06:05.295
Man, they're gonna pay for
this, those Kuki bastards!

06:06.004 --> 06:10.304
Let's bust into their dojo now,
and rescue Big Sister Shiori!

06:11.176 --> 06:13.235
Come, let's not be rash, now.

06:13.779 --> 06:14.768
But why not?

06:15.280 --> 06:18.374
Well, they did go to the trouble of
sending you a letter of challenge.

06:18.484 --> 06:21.715
As long as they're so concerned
about upholding their honor...

06:22.454 --> 06:26.049
I'm sure they won't
mistreat her tonight.

06:32.297 --> 06:35.460
I am Shinzaburo, the
third son of the Kuki clan.

06:36.735 --> 06:41.297
I have placed you in my custody
for tomorrow's grudge match.

06:41.640 --> 06:46.634
But I have no obligation to
assume such a role for you.

06:46.812 --> 06:50.111
It is a duel between the Kuki
School and your traveling companion.

06:50.749 --> 06:52.580
Surely you have no
choice but to be there.

06:59.625 --> 07:02.594
Now, now, Yakumo! Are you
planning to sleep all day?

07:07.332 --> 07:09.698
Where in the world could he have gone?

07:09.835 --> 07:11.029
Princess!

07:11.236 --> 07:12.601
Princess Yuki!

07:13.105 --> 07:14.231
What is it?

07:14.339 --> 07:17.467
Princess, we found this
in front of the gates!

07:17.576 --> 07:19.544
Well, what is it?

07:22.214 --> 07:23.647
Yakumo, you fool!

07:24.082 --> 07:27.176
So you've accepted this challenge
in order to rescue Shiori, have you?

07:27.286 --> 07:30.278
But wait! I might as well
use this to my advantage!

07:30.589 --> 07:32.921
We're going to the
castle. Prepare at once!

07:33.091 --> 07:34.388
Your Highness?

07:55.514 --> 07:57.038
They're pulling out all the stops.

07:57.516 --> 08:00.952
Brother, everything is in place now.

08:01.854 --> 08:02.821
Shinzaburo...

08:03.455 --> 08:05.116
What is it, Brother?

08:05.524 --> 08:09.756
If this plot of yours is what you call the
art of war, then I won't stand in your way.

08:09.828 --> 08:10.886
Nevertheless...

08:11.296 --> 08:14.356
...my sword does not require such
underhanded tactics to prevail.

08:14.566 --> 08:17.433
I shall prove that with a single strike!

08:18.070 --> 08:19.697
But of course, Brother.

08:19.938 --> 08:22.907
The goals of my tactics are
merely to lure the enemy here...

08:23.041 --> 08:25.168
...and then thwart his escape.

08:25.577 --> 08:28.171
Otherwise, I shall leave him to you.

08:29.915 --> 08:31.849
How naive he is...

08:32.518 --> 08:37.956
It's time for me to take over, as head
swordsman of the Kuki Musou Style...

08:39.358 --> 08:40.882
Have you no shame as a warrior...

08:41.460 --> 08:43.724
...resorting to such trickery?

08:44.162 --> 08:45.686
If that's what it takes to win...

08:45.864 --> 08:47.092
You're wasting your time!

08:47.165 --> 08:48.393
Yakumo isn't coming!

08:48.534 --> 08:49.660
Not by a long shot.

08:53.839 --> 08:57.707
I'm nothing to him.

08:58.010 --> 08:59.443
He's not showing up.

09:00.746 --> 09:01.576
He'll come.

09:01.713 --> 09:04.841
I can tell just by
the way you're acting.

09:10.389 --> 09:12.254
You say you have a request?

09:13.025 --> 09:14.117
Yes, Father.

09:14.660 --> 09:17.720
Kazuma Kuki, the head
of the Kuki School...

09:17.896 --> 09:21.024
...has challenged a traveling
swordsman to a duel today...

09:21.466 --> 09:24.264
...at Sanbonmatsu in Rendaigahara.

09:24.570 --> 09:27.562
I am requesting that you
appoint the winner of this duel...

09:27.673 --> 09:30.233
...to the post of
Official Sword Instructor.

09:30.676 --> 09:35.238
And who exactly is this
traveling swordsman?

09:35.514 --> 09:38.711
He is the man I plan to marry... Father.

09:45.090 --> 09:47.320
Yakumo isn't coming.

09:47.759 --> 09:49.283
He's not going to come here.

09:49.528 --> 09:51.189
Yakumo's not...

09:51.396 --> 09:52.658
H-He is here!

09:58.537 --> 09:59.401
Brother!

09:59.504 --> 10:00.368
Right.

10:08.880 --> 10:11.405
So he showed up, did he?

10:14.720 --> 10:15.914
Yakumo...

10:16.488 --> 10:17.750
But why?

10:18.023 --> 10:20.890
No, of course he would show up.

10:21.326 --> 10:23.920
Even if he had no feelings for me...

10:24.363 --> 10:25.796
He'd still come...

10:25.864 --> 10:28.094
Or he wouldn't be Yakumo!

10:37.376 --> 10:40.573
You've come before the appointed
time. You have some nerve.

10:40.812 --> 10:42.837
No, you're the ones with a lot of nerve.

10:42.948 --> 10:44.540
Yeah, for a bunch of cowards!

10:44.983 --> 10:46.712
It's called the art of war.

10:46.985 --> 10:48.009
Just remember that.

11:07.039 --> 11:08.097
Yakumo!

11:08.874 --> 11:11.035
They didn't hurt you, did they?

11:14.179 --> 11:15.111
N-No.

11:17.816 --> 11:18.942
That's good.

11:19.518 --> 11:20.951
Nevertheless...

11:21.086 --> 11:23.111
...it's unfortunate for you guys.

11:23.689 --> 11:26.419
You should've just sent me
a normal letter of challenge.

11:26.825 --> 11:27.814
What?

11:29.628 --> 11:30.560
Big Brother...

11:31.596 --> 11:35.965
But now I'll have to bring on
the demise of the Kuki clan!

11:36.468 --> 11:38.936
H-How dare you!

11:47.279 --> 11:48.268
He's tough...

11:48.380 --> 11:50.075
He's a tough one, that kid!

11:50.182 --> 11:52.275
This will be interesting.

11:53.952 --> 11:58.321
It looks like your friends
went and angered the clouds...

11:58.957 --> 12:00.219
Who the hell are you?

12:03.128 --> 12:05.688
Now, now, you don't want to miss it...

12:15.807 --> 12:18.401
Kuki Musou Style, Zanbaken!

12:18.810 --> 12:19.902
Take this!

12:37.295 --> 12:39.763
He dodged THAT move?

12:50.275 --> 12:51.435
Master!

12:52.144 --> 12:53.475
A single blow!

12:53.578 --> 12:54.567
Powerful...

12:59.918 --> 13:02.614
Kenpo, or rather, atemi jutsu, eh?

13:02.754 --> 13:05.484
I never thought he could
dodge Kazuma's Zanbaken strike...

13:05.590 --> 13:07.717
...and blindside him like that...

13:09.628 --> 13:11.186
What do you know?

13:11.496 --> 13:13.760
All right! Big Brother...

13:13.899 --> 13:14.661
Huh?

13:18.336 --> 13:18.927
What the...

13:23.842 --> 13:24.774
Fire!

13:36.021 --> 13:37.511
Art of war, eh?

13:46.665 --> 13:49.657
You call that fair?
Using muskets on him?

13:52.070 --> 13:52.866
He's moving!

13:53.004 --> 13:54.266
He's still alive!

13:57.442 --> 13:58.636
Yakumo!

13:59.244 --> 14:02.179
Hey, not to worry. It's just a scratch.

14:02.280 --> 14:06.341
Damn! So much for honor,
you guys crossed the line!

14:06.618 --> 14:07.516
Don't move!

14:10.055 --> 14:12.683
If you move, things will
get ugly for this girl.

14:13.792 --> 14:17.057
Is that more of your
famous "art of war"?

14:17.295 --> 14:18.853
You might call it that.

14:20.265 --> 14:22.597
Still, I must say,
you're quite powerful!

14:23.034 --> 14:26.094
You came very close to foiling my plot!

14:26.738 --> 14:29.434
Musketeers! Shoot to kill!

14:30.308 --> 14:33.539
You might be able to dodge
a single bullet, but...

14:34.779 --> 14:37.441
...I am, after all, a
perfectionist, you see...

14:37.582 --> 14:39.846
I hope you don't mind being our target.

14:40.118 --> 14:41.449
Hold still, now!

14:42.254 --> 14:45.917
If only I hadn't let
them take me hostage!

14:47.025 --> 14:50.188
If it weren't for me...

14:56.167 --> 14:58.226
What's the matter? I said fire!

15:48.520 --> 15:49.851
Who the hell are you?

15:52.624 --> 15:54.319
Musashi Miyamoto!

15:54.559 --> 15:57.756
M-Musashi Miyamoto?

15:58.763 --> 15:59.730
Great Master!

16:00.999 --> 16:03.229
That's Musashi Miyamoto?

16:05.003 --> 16:07.062
That man over there is mine!

16:07.372 --> 16:10.808
Oh man, I had to go and run into you!

16:27.192 --> 16:29.558
It just gets better and better.

16:29.728 --> 16:31.593
So you couldn't stay away, Musashi!

16:31.696 --> 16:35.928
You've climbed into
Yakumo's ring at last.

16:36.801 --> 16:37.893
Stay away from me!

16:38.069 --> 16:40.936
Come any closer and I'll kill this girl!

16:41.239 --> 16:42.900
Do whatever you want!

16:43.208 --> 16:44.732
I'll really kill her!

16:46.077 --> 16:46.839
Kill her.

16:52.851 --> 16:54.045
Kill her!

16:59.858 --> 17:01.519
Now! Big Sister Shiori! Get out of here!

17:01.626 --> 17:02.422
You punk!

17:05.430 --> 17:07.295
Kill him! Kill Musashi!

17:18.743 --> 17:19.801
A demon...

17:19.944 --> 17:22.003
He can't be human!

17:22.213 --> 17:24.909
I'll be killed if I don't escape now...

17:31.222 --> 17:32.587
Die!

17:43.835 --> 17:48.772
He threw Shinzaburo to the ground while
digging his knee into his throat...

17:48.907 --> 17:51.307
Now that's the Mutsu Enmei Style.

17:55.280 --> 17:56.872
Mutsu Enmei Style...

17:56.981 --> 18:00.747
Both Kazuma and Shinzaburo
have disgraced our family name.

18:03.655 --> 18:07.523
Before my father died,
he said only this...

18:08.827 --> 18:13.764
"Never have anything to do with
anyone by the name of Mutsu..."

18:13.898 --> 18:18.494
And with Musashi on your side,
my chances are even slimmer.

18:18.670 --> 18:22.299
To honor your father's
dying words, you won't fight.

18:22.440 --> 18:23.031
In that case...

18:23.141 --> 18:26.941
Unfortunately, my father never liked me...

18:27.112 --> 18:29.774
...so I have no intention
of honoring his last words.

18:30.215 --> 18:31.944
The Mutsu Enmei Style...

18:32.283 --> 18:34.342
...and Musashi Miyamoto.

18:34.586 --> 18:40.752
I, Genjiro Kuki, am challenging
each of you to a one-on-one match.

18:43.728 --> 18:45.093
Thank you.

18:45.630 --> 18:46.187
Yakumo...

18:46.331 --> 18:47.423
Wait!

18:52.971 --> 18:54.529
You first, Mutsu.

18:54.973 --> 18:57.999
You have yet to defeat the Kuki Clan...

18:58.476 --> 19:00.808
...I never said I was finished.

19:05.517 --> 19:06.779
This I have to see.

19:29.207 --> 19:33.667
So he's going for the
quick-draw strike...

19:36.047 --> 19:38.515
How can an unarmed man win?

19:39.184 --> 19:44.019
He measures the length of the sword,
makes his opponent strike first, dodges...

19:44.155 --> 19:46.248
...then lunges under his guard.

19:46.357 --> 19:50.259
In that case, he can't very well
measure a sword that hasn't been drawn.

19:59.037 --> 20:02.200
They're in striking distance
but he can't reach him unarmed!

20:02.674 --> 20:03.402
I win!

20:08.313 --> 20:11.441
You fool! You can't
reach me with your fist!

20:18.957 --> 20:19.753
What the...

20:33.071 --> 20:34.003
He did it!

20:35.707 --> 20:40.144
True, he kept his blade out of sight,
but he couldn't conceal his hand.

20:42.013 --> 20:45.005
Just as you said...

20:47.151 --> 20:52.612
...the Kuki clan met its demise today.

21:16.614 --> 21:21.551
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.697 --> 21:44.734
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at
them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:45.009 --> 21:54.748
<i>My loneliness and the vast night
sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:54.886 --> 22:03.885
<i>I just don't know what this
dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:04.028 --> 22:14.700
<i>Even if it's just hello,
I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.740 --> 22:21.872
<i>The person I am today
is about to disappear...</i>

22:22.246 --> 22:25.238
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:26.117 --> 22:32.386
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.690 --> 22:38.151
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:53.277 --> 22:54.767
The time has come...

22:55.146 --> 22:59.583
...for Musashi's sword to roar
and Yakumo's fists to explode!

23:00.418 --> 23:02.579
Next episode of the Age of Chaos...

23:02.687 --> 23:04.416
<i>THE ULTIMATE WARRIORS</i>

23:04.856 --> 23:06.983
Pay close attention, and wait!
